00:05:09.506 --> 00:05:11.382
Please don't do this to me again.

00:05:14.344 --> 00:05:15.470
Please.

00:05:18.306 --> 00:05:19.390
Wait.

00:06:06.771 --> 00:06:08.314
You're doing well.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.685
You can do this.

00:06:12.652 --> 00:06:13.987
You're just like me.

00:06:48.062 --> 00:06:48.896
Ke!

