Are you busy?

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.274
Why?

00:06:51.399 --> 00:06:55.612
So I found this cafe near Kalix's office.

00:06:55.612 --> 00:06:57.155
Come on. Come with me.

00:06:57.155 --> 00:07:00.158
Ugh, you just want company
while you wait for Kalix.

00:07:00.742 --> 00:07:02.201
Come on, please?

00:07:02.368 --> 00:07:05.455
Wait, are you even
