It's decaf. Besides, it's my treat.

00:07:08.249 --> 00:07:09.042
Okay.

00:07:09.626 --> 00:07:11.169
Oh, so now you're in when it's free?

00:07:11.336 --> 00:07:13.379
All right, all right, I'll get ready.
See you in a bit.

00:07:13.379 --> 00:07:14.964
