00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:36.110
And you,

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:38.821
you shouldn't be having coffee
too often either, even if it's decaf.

00:07:38.821 --> 00:07:40.323
Gotta take care of the baby.

00:07:40.323 --> 00:07:42.617
Right, baby? Mommy
shouldn't be so stubborn.

00:07:42.617 --> 00:07:44.911
Hey, I just ordered
strawberry milk instead, okay.

00:07:45.995 --> 00:07:46.579
Geez.

00:07:46.579 --> 00:07:47.955
Oh, by the way!

00:07:47.955 --> 00:07:49.582
Have you heard about Amethyst?

00:07:49.582 --> 00:07:51.584
The attempted murder?

00:07:51.959 --> 00:07:54.462
I really wish that
case would move faster.

00:07:56.089 --> 00:07:58.007
So many people are waiting on it.

00:07:58.299 --> 00:07:59.509
Speaking of.

00:08:04.305 --> 00:08:05.807
Oh, it's my baby.

00:08:08.826 --> 00:08:10.995
That governor's probably gonna win again.

