are still some decent people out there.

00:08:21.155 --> 00:08:24.951
I hope they haven't been
paid off or blinded by money yet.

00:08:24.951 --> 00:08:27.453
It's so hard to trust anyone these days.

00:08:27.453 --> 00:08:29.497
Look at his kid. It took so long
to get him locked up,

00:08:29.497 --> 00:08:32.834
even though there's so much
he still needs to answer for.

00:08:39.632 --> 00:08:40.341
Hi, Love.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:44.097
