- Hi.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.529
Have you guys had lunch yet?

00:08:49.554 --> 00:08:51.306
Join us for lunch. Come on.

00:08:51.352 --> 00:08:55.273
Thank you, but I'll just take it to go.
I'm on a working lunch break.

00:08:55.273 --> 00:08:59.402
I'm meeting Prosecutor Lopez
