that he will be sending
to jail if he wins the case.

00:09:18.337 --> 00:09:19.714
What do you mean?

00:09:22.925 --> 00:09:25.803
That he's the prosecutor
who got Miguel in jail.

00:09:28.473 --> 00:09:33.352
He got the first prosecutor suspended,
and he also replaced them.

00:09:34.145 --> 00:09:37.857
So, let's just say that he
won the case without mercy.

00:09:44.947 --> 00:09:46.341
Love, come on.

00:09:46.532 --> 00:09:49.368
Come on. Stop defending Fiscal Lopez.

00:09:50.036 --> 00:09:52.830
She has a reason
to be mad at him, remember?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:55.374
Besides, you and Sunday
aren't even close, right?

00:09:56.023 --> 00:09:57.441
We're actually close.

00:09:58.878 --> 00:10:00.755
I'm not interested in him anymore, okay?

00:10:00.755 --> 00:10:02.840
Yeah, that's over. I'm done with that.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:03.716
Yeah, it's over.

00:10:03.716 --> 00:10:04.884
It's fine now.

00:10:22.109 --> 00:10:24.153
So he really did do it.

00:10:39.335 --> 00:10:40.837
Damn it.

00:10:46.926 --> 00:10:48.094
Where are you even looking?

00:10:48.094 --> 00:10:49.595
Why'd you just suddenly
back straight out like that?

00:12:42.541 --> 00:12:43.834
I was happy back then.

00:12:44.126 --> 00:12:46.796
Especially when I was young.
