00:12:58.349 --> 00:13:01.268
No, mine's farther. Look.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.772
Oh no, are you okay?

00:13:04.772 --> 00:13:07.024
- Yes. I'm okay.
- Are you crying?

00:13:08.067 --> 00:13:10.444
