00:13:10.569 --> 00:13:11.612
Baby!

00:13:12.238 --> 00:13:13.531
What happened?

00:13:15.366 --> 00:13:16.492
Are you okay?

00:13:17.326 --> 00:13:18.119
Are you okay?

00:13:18.119 --> 00:13:19.078
Does it hurt?

00:13:19.078 --> 00:13:21.789
No, mom. I'm not gonna cry
because it doesn't hurt.

00:13:22.623 --> 00:13:26.085
Baby, it's okay. It's okay to cry, okay?

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:28.421
If it hurts, just cry.

00:13:28.421 --> 00:13:30.923
Mommy is here.
Mommy is always here, okay?

00:13:33.092 --> 00:13:37.847
If you cry, I'll cry with you
so we're the same.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:42.685
Having Luna,

00:13:43.102 --> 00:13:45.312
I knew I always had
someone in my corner.

00:13:47.982 --> 00:13:50.985
Ke! Do Teacher Sandra.

00:13:50.985 --> 00:13:55.364
Luna, Kierra! Stop being so annoying.

00:13:55.364 --> 00:13:57.408
You're so loud, Kierra.

00:13:57.491 --> 00:13:59.035
