00:13:59.035 --> 00:14:00.036
You're so gonna get it.

00:14:00.036 --> 00:14:02.788
Huh! Why only me?

00:14:03.581 --> 00:14:06.792
Just ignore Harold,
he's just seeking attention.

00:14:06.792 --> 00:14:09.545
Yeah, we're not even doing anything to him.

00:14:09.545 --> 00:14:12.048
But he's always mean to me.

00:14:12.381 --> 00:14:16.343
The other day,
he even made fun of my hair.

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:19.138
It's because he's got
a crush on you, that's why.

00:14:19.138 --> 00:14:21.307
He just wants your attention.

00:14:21.307 --> 00:14:22.683
That's fine.

00:14:22.683 --> 00:14:24.018
Oh...

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.812
So you're supposed
to be mean to your crush?

00:14:31.984 --> 00:14:35.863
Yeah, seriously, I already ate.

00:14:36.322 --> 00:14:38.365
Have you eaten?

00:14:40.367 --> 00:14:41.994
I miss you.

00:14:41.994 --> 00:14:44.455
All right, see you next week.

00:14:44.455 --> 00:14:46.582
Okay, I love you.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.962
When's it gonna be my turn?

00:14:51.962 --> 00:14:53.714
But I was jealous.

00:14:53.714 --> 00:14:56.008
I wanted to be in love like that.

00:14:56.008 --> 00:14:57.676
