00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.678
I want a romantic comedy.

00:15:00.012 --> 00:15:01.055
Huh? Romantic comedy?

00:15:01.055 --> 00:15:03.057
- Didn't we just watch one last week?
- Yeah, we did.

00:15:03.057 --> 00:15:05.518
I just really want
to feel the butterflies, mommy.

00:15:05.518 --> 00:15:06.811
Butterflies? Why?

00:15:06.811 --> 00:15:08.729
Is someone at school
making you feel giddy?

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.232
Is someone courting you, sweetie?

00:15:11.398 --> 00:15:13.400
Introduce him to me. Bring him here.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:14.777
- Daddy, no-
- Just an interview.

00:15:14.777 --> 00:15:15.611
It's just gonna be an interview.

00:15:15.611 --> 00:15:18.030
There's no one, that's
why I want to feel giddy.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.658
Besides, I don't have a crush
on anyone there. None of them are my type.

00:15:21.117 --> 00:15:23.619
This daughter of mine
is really something else, huh.

00:15:29.458 --> 00:15:32.086
Well, what do you want?

00:15:35.297 --> 00:15:37.925
I want what you and daddy have.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:43.681
I want that love that
you guys have for each other.

00:15:47.059 --> 00:15:51.021
Someday you will find that someone.

00:15:52.481 --> 00:15:55.317
I can't wait for that someday to come.

00:16:22.011 --> 00:16:24.513
How are you feeling, Kierra?

00:16:24.513 --> 00:16:26.473
It's been months since your last visit.

00:16:27.349 --> 00:16:29.018
I'm okay.

00:16:29.518 --> 00:16:32.730
Really? You look tired.

00:16:33.022 --> 00:16:34.895
