00:16:35.691 --> 00:16:37.151
Yes.

00:16:39.069 --> 00:16:41.020
Sometimes I wake up at night.

00:16:43.387 --> 00:16:44.480
I keep

00:16:45.666 --> 00:16:47.043
having these

00:16:47.635 --> 00:16:48.552
dreams...

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.261
memories?

00:16:50.539 --> 00:16:51.624
Dreams?

00:16:51.957 --> 00:16:53.167
What dreams?

00:17:04.343 --> 00:17:05.426
I’m...

00:17:06.847 --> 00:17:08.410
in a parking lot.

00:17:21.278 --> 00:17:22.404
Then-

00:17:25.741 --> 00:17:26.659
Sorry.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.329
I don't want to talk about it anymore.

00:17:30.753 --> 00:17:31.732
Um...

00:17:32.122 --> 00:17:34.250
I just want to forget it.

00:17:37.044 --> 00:17:38.545
I see.

00:17:38.587 --> 00:17:41.548
It's okay. You don't
have to force yourself.

00:17:46.636 --> 00:17:48.595
