00:17:50.557 --> 00:17:51.535
I feel...

00:17:53.403 --> 00:17:55.980
I feel suffocated.

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:05.239
When I'm at home-

00:18:08.251 --> 00:18:09.761
it's like I can't breathe.

00:18:12.035 --> 00:18:13.644
And when I'm outside,

00:18:15.958 --> 00:18:17.636
I feel anxious.

00:18:18.836 --> 00:18:20.045
I'm-

00:18:20.045 --> 00:18:21.636
I'm afraid I might...

00:18:22.923 --> 00:18:24.707
I might bump into him.

00:18:32.815 --> 00:18:34.442
I feel like I'm...

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:37.043
I'm in a...

00:18:39.231 --> 00:18:42.151
I feel like I'm trapped in two places.

00:18:48.324 --> 00:18:51.560
I don't know where I can hide.

00:18:58.077 --> 00:19:01.498
So right now, what do you want to do?

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.732
I want to breathe.

00:19:29.782 --> 00:19:31.033
Let it out.

00:20:06.241 --> 00:20:08.072
Put those in the bag there.

00:20:08.097 --> 00:20:10.599
- Uncle! Auntie!
- Hi!

00:20:11.281 --> 00:20:12.366
Hello.

00:20:14.868 --> 00:20:15.536
