Is this our food?

00:20:18.557 --> 00:20:19.475
Of course.

00:20:19.516 --> 00:20:21.226
This is gonna be good for a week.

00:20:21.251 --> 00:20:22.836
Glad you guys stopped by.

00:20:22.936 --> 00:20:26.606
School's about to start. So you'd better
stock up before you guys get busy again.

00:20:26.755 --> 00:20:27.631
Yeah.

00:20:28.215 --> 00:20:29.800
How are you?

00:20:31.535 --> 00:20:33.087
Looks like you didn't
get much sleep last night.

00:20:33.111 --> 00:20:33.587
Mhmm.

00:20:33.612 --> 00:20:34.179
Um-

00:20:34.179 --> 00:20:36.265
We just watched too many movies.

00:20:37.891 --> 00:20:38.934
Are you sure?

00:20:38.985 --> 00:20:41.195
Because if you're having
trouble sleeping again,

00:20:41.353 --> 00:20:43.063
we can visit your doctor.

00:20:43.088 --> 00:20:44.881
No, I'm really okay.

00:20:44.906 --> 00:20:47.075
Actually, I just came from therapy earlier.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.520
And I think we're making good progress.

00:20:50.687 --> 00:20:53.190
Slowly but surely, I'll be okay too.

00:20:53.476 --> 00:20:54.644
That's good to hear, sweetie.

00:20:54.669 --> 00:20:56.296
It really is better
when the sessions are regular.

00:20:56.321 --> 00:20:58.197
So, just keep it up, okay.

00:20:58.328 --> 00:20:58.912
Mhmm.

00:20:58.912 --> 00:21:02.499
And don't worry, Uncle, Auntie, Kierra's
got a personal caregiver right here.

00:21:02.499 --> 00:21:04.251
All set. And free, too.

00:21:05.043 --> 00:21:08.005
Luna, thank you. You really are an angel.

00:21:08.297 --> 00:21:09.089
Come.

00:21:09.089 --> 00:21:10.466
Eat first before you guys leave.

00:21:10.466 --> 00:21:11.133
Come on, let's go.

00:21:11.133 --> 00:21:12.801
- Come on now.
- I'm hungry.

00:21:13.844 --> 00:21:15.892
Wow.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.415
This looks so good.

00:21:27.691 --> 00:21:31.069
Ke! Via and I are still out,
