00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:45.125
Ah, I'm fine here. Enjoy yourselves.

00:21:45.125 --> 00:21:47.628
Okay. Bye-bye.

00:21:47.666 --> 00:21:49.017
Okay, bye.

00:21:50.255 --> 00:21:51.465
