00:22:46.457 --> 00:22:48.167
But I'm eating out.

00:22:49.642 --> 00:22:50.818
Should we go see her?

00:22:51.595 --> 00:22:55.265
Ke, where are you? We'll come meet you.

00:22:55.654 --> 00:22:56.655
No, no need.

00:22:56.655 --> 00:22:58.365
I'm fine, Luna.

00:22:58.532 --> 00:23:02.578
But Ke, you don't like eating out alone.

00:23:03.245 --> 00:23:04.329
I'm okay.

00:23:04.329 --> 00:23:06.832
It's okay. I'm at Claremont Hotel.

00:23:07.541 --> 00:23:10.586
The last time I went
here, I was with him.

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:14.172
And he hates it here.

00:23:14.381 --> 00:23:21.096
He said the service was shitty,
the food tastes awful,

00:23:22.389 --> 00:23:23.932
so he said he's never coming back.

00:23:24.683 --> 00:23:28.520
So I'm sure I won't run into him.

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:30.272
So don't worry, okay?

00:23:30.856 --> 00:23:33.191
I'll head home right after I eat.

00:23:33.358 --> 00:23:36.028
Okay, all right. Just message us, okay?

00:23:36.028 --> 00:23:37.279
We'll come get you right away.

00:23:37.279 --> 00:23:38.780
We're here for you, Ke.

00:23:39.072 --> 00:23:41.241
Thank you, Luna, Via.

00:23:56.298 --> 00:23:57.591
Fuck.

00:23:57.841 --> 00:23:59.635
The food here is so bad.

00:24:09.186 --> 00:24:10.354
Excuse me!

00:24:35.871 --> 00:24:37.581
Excuse me, Miss?

00:24:37.606 --> 00:24:38.732
Is something wrong?

00:24:41.718 --> 00:24:43.178
Who are you?

00:24:43.845 --> 00:24:45.138
