00:25:53.749 --> 00:25:56.418
Please tell me ice cream is
your favorite comfort food.

00:25:57.210 --> 00:25:59.880
I mean, if I'm wrong
I'd feel guilty about it.

00:26:01.882 --> 00:26:05.177
Yeah, ice cream, but you
got the wrong flavor.

00:26:06.249 --> 00:26:08.669
I like chocolate, not vanilla.

00:26:08.694 --> 00:26:10.404
But on some occasions,
I like strawberry.

00:26:10.743 --> 00:26:14.288
