00:26:24.905 --> 00:26:26.948
Don't worry, it's free.

00:26:26.948 --> 00:26:29.534
And next time you can be
the one to treat me to ice cream.

00:26:29.731 --> 00:26:30.982
There won't be a next time.

00:26:31.329 --> 00:26:32.164
There will be.

00:26:33.330 --> 00:26:34.289
Trust me.

